## Production vm.args - uses default values without variable substitution
## For containerized deployment where environment variables override these

## Node name (required by Erlang, but not used for distribution)
-name a2a@127.0.0.1

## Cookie for distributed erlang
-setcookie a2a_cookie

## Enable SMP
+S 4:4

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
+Q 65536

## Increase process count
+P 1000000

## Enable kernel poll
+K true

## Use async threads
+A 64

## Garbage collection
+hms 233

## Allocator settings for memory efficiency
+MBas aobf
+MBlmbcs 512
+MEas aobf
